 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** $O(W \times H)$ to generate the noise data. Texture upload is also $O(W \times H)$ but depends on memory bandwidth.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(W \times H)$ to store the noise data. For `GL_RGB32F`, this is $12$ bytes per pixel. For `GL_R8`, it is $1$ byte per pixel [S1, S3, unofficial].
+- **Time Complexity:** $O(W \times H)$ to generate the noise data [G]. Texture upload is also $O(W \times H)$ but depends on memory bandwidth [G].
